# The Swift SDK's bridge, whose IDZBridge this plugin's JavaScript calls directly. Until IdenzyCore,
# Idenzy and IdenzyBridge are on CocoaPods trunk an app declares them itself, by path, in
# App_Resources/iOS/Podfile; declared here as well, CocoaPods would refuse the two sources. On
# publishing this becomes `pod 'IdenzyBridge', '0.1.0'`.
